## 4️⃣ **Performance & Code Quality**

| # | Task | Priority | Description |
|---|------|----------|-------------|
| 4.1 | Reduce unnecessary re‑renders | Medium | Many components re‑fetch data on every interval. Use React `useCallback` and `useMemo` correctly. |
| 4.2 | Implement WebSocket for live chat instead of polling? | High | Already using `@twurple/chat` WebSocket. No change needed. But ensure the connection is shared across components. |
| 4.3 | Combine `useAlertsFeed` and `useStreamEvents` into one hook | High | Both do the same thing – unify into `useStreamEvents` and remove duplicate. |
| 4.4 | Move `globalConnectionPromise` from `useSceneManager` to a singleton service | Medium | The global variable is a workaround; better to use a React Context or a module‑level state. |
| 4.5 | Remove unused imports and components | Low | Many files import `Search`, `Info`, etc. but not used. Clean up. |
| 4.6 | Add error boundaries for each card | Medium | Prevent one failed component from crashing the whole page. |

